# Conditional content computed in ThermalPrinterCommandBuilder.ApplyRetail2x725 — see
# lt_retail_45x3.sato's header comment for the general approach and simplifications
# (this size adds one more: legacy hardcodes prt-qty="01" for this size regardless of
# the requested copy count, faithfully reproduced below as a literal \x1bQ1).
# Also omits legacy's separate throwaway EX0 buffer-extend pre-job (85-model-only
# compatibility workaround, "ignored by S86" per its own comment).

